damaged_code:
```rust
impl Future for MyFuture {
    type Output = ();
    fn poll(self: Pin<&mut Self>, cx: &mut Context<'_>) -> Poll<Self::Output> {
        if self.is_ready() {
            Poll::Ready(())
        } else {
            // BUG: Fails to store cx.waker(). The future returns Pending,
            // but the executor has no way of knowing when to poll again!
            Poll::Pending 
        }
    }
}
```

fix:
Register the waker with the underlying event source before returning `Pending`.
```rust
fn poll(mut self: Pin<&mut Self>, cx: &mut Context<'_>) -> Poll<Self::Output> {
    if self.is_ready() {
         Poll::Ready(())
    } else {
         self.waker = Some(cx.waker().clone());
         Poll::Pending
    }
}
```
